<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77940" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραδοξ-άζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make wonderful</i> or <i>extraordinary</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>2 Ma.</u>
				3.30
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς πληγάς σου</span>
			<i>will lay unheard-of</i> inflictions <i>upon</i> thee,
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>De.</u>
				28.59
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἀνὰ μέσον τῶν κτηνῶν</span>
			<i>put a mark of distinction</i> between, <i>separate</i>,
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ex.</u>
				9.4
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὴν γῆν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				8.22
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
